{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026L7AzNspvbF1794651793.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>深圳APEC燈光表演周六、日在市民中心觀賞區的預約已額滿。</p><p></p><p>深圳市民中心周四晚開始，連續四晚舉行APEC燈光表演，設七點、八點、九點三個場次，43棟摩天樓宇由同一套系統聯動，在270度環幕天際線上變換影像。當局提醒民眾可透過微信小程序預約到場觀賞，並合理規劃出行時間。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SZ.LIGHT-1800_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026iM6Ke7vhMP1794651872.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>但早前有民眾反映預約後到場，由於現場人數太多，無法入場。社交網站上亦有深圳市民指，某些觀賞區是先到先得，不用預約亦可入內。而微信小程序顯示，周六、日市民中心的預約已全部額滿。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SZ.LIGHT-1800_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026V7M174ILeI1794651891.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>蓮花山公園山頂及深圳少年宮，則毋須預約也可觀賞燈光表演。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T11:03:57.501005+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T10:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T10:57:13.817523+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T10:57:13.817523+00:00","content_hash":"0f68755a34f0f3060553dce34c55c722352a1fdbf245dbe487d038003c3f901a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}